    "reference": "Authorization bead bu-vkkip2 for implementation bead bu-ly3lv5.14 (PR #4742, route every connector ingest submit through one status-checking helper so only an accepted Switchboard ingest reply counts as a submission). Reviewed before: main 7cbcbfa13faa1fbe593d6a0fbb57555adeeed888 as recorded in bu-m0jwd1; approved subject: PR #4742 head 8c2d75af0f98952c595d54f8d015aaa1ae938bed plus the reviewer-computed clause (spec-clause.patch) and request. Governing requirement REQ-connector-base-spec-008 (Connector as Ingestion Primitive) in openspec/specs/connector-base-spec/spec.md, whose ID-only header lands in this same change; the change adds one scenario inside the block. The 7 owners are setup-only retained-test edits that replace non-conforming mock replies with the real Switchboard reply {\"status\": \"accepted\"}; no assertion changes. This exact manifest requires its own independent review and protected-main publication before consumption; provenance text grants no runtime admission."
